#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment using containerized proxy"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr} ໂດຍໃຊ້ containerized proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:2
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To set up the {productname} {smr} environment, you will need to have already "
"installed and configured:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໄວ້ກ່ອນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} {smr} Server 4.3 or newer"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} Server 4.3 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:3
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} {smr} Server"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:5
msgid "one or more {productname} {smr} containerized proxies"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} containerized proxies ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:6
msgid "one or more {productname} build host"
msgstr "{productname} build host ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This section covers how to configure your environment using containerized "
"{productname} Proxy for [systemitem]``Saltboot`` deployment."
msgstr "ສ່ວນນີ້ຈະອະທິບາຍວິທີກຳນົດຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ containerized {productname} Proxy ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ [systemitem]``Saltboot``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow not longer implicitly configures DHCP for PXE "
"booting.  Without the formula, make sure your DHCP server has correct PXE "
"booting setting pointing to containerized proxy.  For more information how "
"to use DHCP formula to configure DHCP server, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ Containerized ຈະບໍ່ກຳນົດຄ່າ DHCP ສຳລັບການບູດ PXE ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຟໍມູລາ, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າເຊີເວີ DHCP ຂອງທ່ານມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PXE ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຊີ້ໄປຫາ containerized proxy ແລ້ວ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ຟໍມູລາ DHCP, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-dhcpd.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements and assumptions"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການ ແລະ ຂໍ້ກຳນົດເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow requires POS images build using {productname} Server "
"4.3 or newer.  Older images will not work."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນແບບ Containerized ຕ້ອງການ POS images ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ {productname} Server 4.3 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ອິເມຈລຸ້ນເກົ່າຈະໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow requires POS images build using the newest "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນແບບ Containerized ຕ້ອງການ POS images ທີ່ສ້າງດ້ວຍ {productname} Server ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ລ່າສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:12
msgid "In this example we are going to use branch id [systemitem]``B0001``."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ branch id [systemitem]``B0001``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:13
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:12
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:12
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:11
msgid ""
"As a terminal we assume to have one terminal with hardware manufacturer "
"[systemitem]``TerminalOEM`` and model [systemitem]``T1000``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເທີມິນໍ ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າມີເທີມິນໍໜຶ່ງຕົວຈາກຜູ້ຜະລິດ [systemitem]``TerminalOEM`` ແລະ ລຸ້ນ [systemitem]``T1000``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:14
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:13
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:13
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For POS image we assume to have one with name "
"[systemitem]``POS_Image_JeOS7``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ POS image ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າມີອິເມຈຊື່ [systemitem]``POS_Image_JeOS7``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:15
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create required system groups"
msgstr "ສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Create the following three system groups.  For guidelines on how to create "
"the groups, see xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບສາມກຸ່ມດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ສຳລັບວິທີການສ້າງກຸ່ມ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:18
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:18
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:36
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:16
msgid "[systemitem]``TERMINALS``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``TERMINALS``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:19
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:19
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:17
msgid "[systemitem]``HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:20
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:20
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:18
msgid "[systemitem]``B0001``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``B0001``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:21
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:21
msgid ""
"The first group is generic optional group for collecting all POS terminals.  "
"The second group is hardware type group for our POS terminal.  The third "
"group is mandatory branch group."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມທຳອິດແມ່ນກຸ່ມທົ່ວໄປ (ເລືອກໄດ້) ສຳລັບລວມເທີມິນໍ POS ທັງໝົດ. ກຸ່ມທີສອງແມ່ນກຸ່ມປະເພດຮາດແວສຳລັບເທີມິນໍ POS ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ກຸ່ມທີສາມແມ່ນກຸ່ມສາຂາທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:22
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:22
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:20
msgid ""
"For more information about {saltboot} groups, see "
"xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກຸ່ມ {saltboot}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Assign [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` formula to group [systemitem]``B0001`` "
"we just created.  This converts the branch group to [systemitem]``Saltboot "
"Group``."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຟໍມູລາ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມ [systemitem]``B0001`` ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຫາກໍ່ສ້າງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນກຸ່ມສາຂາໃຫ້ເປັນ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group``."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:24
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "{saltboot} group"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Containerized {productname} {smr} is configured in [systemitem]``Saltboot "
"Group``."
msgstr "Containerized {productname} {smr} ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢູ່ໃນ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:26
msgid ""
"{saltboot} groups are branch groups, system group with [systemitem]``branch "
"id`` as its name and [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` formula enabled."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ {saltboot} ແມ່ນກຸ່ມສາຂາ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ມີຊື່ເປັນ [systemitem]``branch id`` ແລະ ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຟໍມູລາ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:27
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` formula is a successor of "
"[systemitem]``Branch Network formula``, [systemitem]``PXE formula`` and "
"[systemitem]``TFTP formula`` used in regular {productname} {smr} setups."
msgstr "ຟໍມູລາ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ມາແທນທີ່ [systemitem]``Branch Network formula``, [systemitem]``PXE formula`` ແລະ [systemitem]``TFTP formula`` ທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {smr} ແບບປົກກະຕິ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Name of the [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` is automatically used as a "
"[systemitem]``branch id``, an identifier for group of machines booted "
"through particular containerized {productname} Proxy."
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເປັນ [systemitem]``branch id`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນຕົວລະບຸສຳລັບກຸ່ມເຄື່ອງທີ່ບູດຜ່ານ containerized {productname} Proxy ນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:29
msgid ""
"All [systemitem]``Saltboot`` deployed machines though containerized proxy "
"will automatically became members of its [systemitem]``Saltboot group``."
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງທັງໝົດທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານ [systemitem]``Saltboot`` ຜ່ານ containerized proxy ຈະກາຍເປັນສະມາຊິກຂອງ [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:30
msgid ""
"To connect [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` with containerized proxy, fill "
"[systemitem]``Image Download Server`` entry with Fully Qualified Domain Name "
"([literal]``FQDN``) of the containerized proxy."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` ເຂົ້າກັບ containerized proxy, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ [systemitem]``Image Download Server`` ດ້ວຍ Fully Qualified Domain Name ([literal]``FQDN``) ຂອງ containerized proxy ຕົວນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:31
msgid ""
"With this, mandatory configuration is finished.  The rest of configuration "
"is optional."
msgstr "ພຽງເທົ່ານີ້, ການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນກໍສຳເລັດແລ້ວ. ສ່ວນທີ່ເຫຼືອແມ່ນການກຳນົດຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Default boot image"
msgstr "ບູດອິເມຈເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Default boot image)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Configure [systemitem]``Default boot image for new registrations`` to "
"specify what boot image should be booted by not yet registered POS terminal."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ [systemitem]``Default boot image for new registrations`` ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າຄວນໃຊ້ບູດອິເມຈໃດສຳລັບເທີມິນໍ POS ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:34
msgid ""
"This is useful when stable boot image is wanted for initial deployments.  "
"Without this setting, newest built boot image is used as default boot image."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ບູດອິເມຈທີ່ຄົງທີ່ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ຫາກບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, ບູດອິເມຈໃໝ່ລ່າສຸດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:35
msgid ""
"If [systemitem]``Default boot image for new registrations`` is set, option "
"to set its version appears under name [systemitem]``Default boot image "
"version`` where specific image version can be set."
msgstr "ຫາກມີການກຳນົດ [systemitem]``Default boot image for new registrations``, ຈະມີຕົວເລືອກ [systemitem]``Default boot image version`` ປະກົດຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ລະບຸເວີຊັນຂອງອິເມຈທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Kernel option for the {saltboot} group"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ Kernel ສຳລັບກຸ່ມ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Option [systemitem]``Kernel parameters for the group`` can be used to pass "
"extra kernel options to all POS terminals registered withing this {saltboot} "
"group."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ [systemitem]``Kernel parameters for the group`` ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອສົ່ງຄ່າ Kernel ເພີ່ມເຕີມໃຫ້ກັບເທີມິນໍ POS ທັງໝົດທີ່ລົງທະບຽນຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ {saltboot} ນີ້."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming scheme for new registrations"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການຕັ້ງຊື່ສຳລັບການລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Last three options are related to how will be newly registered machine "
"visible in {productname} Server."
msgstr "ສາມຕົວເລືອກສຸດທ້າຍແມ່ນກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບວິທີການສະແດງຊື່ເຄື່ອງທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໃໝ່ໃນ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For explanation of possible configurations, see "
"xref:retail:retail-terminal-names.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳອະທິບາຍກ່ຽວກັບການກຳນົດຄ່າຕ່າງໆ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:retail:retail-terminal-names.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Comparing containerized and non-containerized workflows"
msgstr "ປຽບທຽບຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກແບບ containerized ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນ containerized"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:42
msgid "External DHCP service must be used with containerized {saltboot}."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ບໍລິການ DHCP ຈາກພາຍນອກຮ່ວມກັບ containerized {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For more information about how to enable PXE booting in DHCP service, see "
"xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີເປີດໃຊ້ PXE boot ໃນບໍລິການ DHCP, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:retail:retail-install-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:44
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow relies on updated image building in {productname} "
"Server 4.3, where PXE images are no longer collected as bundle, but kernel, "
"initrd and filesystem image are collected individually."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນແບບ Containerized ອາໄສລະບົບການສ້າງອິເມຈທີ່ອັບເດດໃໝ່ໃນ {productname} Server 4.3, ເຊິ່ງ PXE images ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເປັນມັດດຽວອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ແຕ່ kernel, initrd ແລະ filesystem image ຈະຖືກແຍກເກັບເປັນສ່ວນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow relies on updated image building in {productname} "
"Server, where PXE images are no longer collected as bundle, but kernel, "
"initrd and filesystem image are collected individually."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນແບບ Containerized ອາໄສລະບົບການສ້າງອິເມຈທີ່ອັບເດດໃໝ່ໃນ {productname} Server, ເຊິ່ງ PXE images ຈະບໍ່ຖືກລວມເປັນມັດດຽວອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ແຕ່ kernel, initrd ແລະ filesystem image ຈະຖືກແຍກເກັບເປັນສ່ວນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Containerized workflow uses new TFTP container which instead of providing "
"files present on the proxy, routes TFTP requests as HTTP requests through "
"local proxy to {productname} Server."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນແບບ Containerized ໃຊ້ TFTP container ໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງແທນທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ proxy, ມັນຈະສົ່ງຄຳຂໍ TFTP ເປັນຄຳຂໍ HTTP ຜ່ານ local proxy ໄປຫາ {productname} Server ແທນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Containerized proxy is not a {salt} client, it is not possible to call "
"[systemitem]``image-sync`` state."
msgstr "Containerized proxy ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {salt} client, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ [systemitem]``image-sync`` ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Once POS image is built and made available on {productname} Server, it is "
"immediately available to the {saltboot} clients as well.  Image "
"synchronization is not needed, nor available.  This may have implications on "
"how images are deployed to production."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ POS image ຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານໃນ {productname} Server ແລ້ວ, ມັນຈະພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ {saltboot} clients ທັນທີ. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຊິງຄ໌ອິເມຈ (Image synchronization). ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດມີຜົນຕໍ່ວິທີການຕິດຕັ້ງອິເມຈໃນລະບົບຈິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:49
msgid ""
"The following sections differentiate between containerized and regular "
"workflow.  Both are assuming proxy (containerized or in form of "
"{productname} {smr} Branch Server) are available."
msgstr "ສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະແຍກຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນແບບ containerized ແລະ ແບບປົກກະຕິ. ທັງສອງແບບສົມມຸດວ່າມີ proxy (ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນແບບ containerized ຫຼື {productname} {smr} Branch Server) ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ."

#. Containerized workflow::
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying with containerized workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ containerized workflow"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:51
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:56
msgid "Build POS image"
msgstr "ສ້າງ POS image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:52
msgid "Configure DHCP server for PXE booting for given network"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີ DHCP ສຳລັບ PXE booting ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Create [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` and configure it for existing "
"containerized proxy"
msgstr "ສ້າງ [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າໃຫ້ກັບ containerized proxy ທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:54
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:61
msgid "Boot system to be deployed"
msgstr "ບູດລະບົບທີ່ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. Non-Containerized workflow::
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying with non-ontainerized workflow"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ non-containerized workflow (ແບບປົກກະຕິ)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:57
msgid "Configure and apply Retail formulas on {productname} {smr} Branch server"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ ແລະ ນຳໃຊ້ Retail formulas ໃນ {productname} {smr} Branch server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:58
msgid "Apply [systemitem]``highstate`` state on the Branch server"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ [systemitem]``highstate`` ໃນ Branch server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Create [systemitem]``branch group`` with the name of Branch ID as set in "
"retail formulas"
msgstr "ສ້າງ [systemitem]``branch group`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ Branch ID ຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໃນ retail formulas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Apply [systemitem]``image-sync`` state on configured {productname} {smr} "
"Branch server"
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ [systemitem]``image-sync`` ໃນ {productname} {smr} Branch server ທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Validating {saltboot} group configuration"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງການກຳນົດຄ່າກຸ່ມ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:63
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``Containerized Saltboot`` utilizes [systemitem]``Cobbler`` "
"system underneath for managing PXE and UEFI configuration."
msgstr "[systemitem]``Containerized Saltboot`` ໃຊ້ລະບົບ [systemitem]``Cobbler`` ເພື່ອຈັດການການກຳນົດຄ່າ PXE ແລະ UEFI."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:64
msgid ""
"When new PXE image is built (such as {productname} {smr} POS_Image_JeOS "
"images) [systemitem]``cobbler distro`` and [systemitem]``cobbler profile`` "
"are automatically generated for this image."
msgstr "ເມື່ອມີການສ້າງ PXE image ໃໝ່ (ເຊັ່ນ {productname} {smr} POS_Image_JeOS) [systemitem]``cobbler distro`` ແລະ [systemitem]``cobbler profile`` ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບອິເມຈນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:65
msgid ""
"For example, when first image [literal]``POS_Image_JeOS`` version "
"[literal]``7.0.0`` is build under organization with number 1 "
"[command]``cobbler list`` will show:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເມື່ອອິເມຈທຳອິດ [literal]``POS_Image_JeOS`` ເວີຊັນ [literal]``7.0.0`` ຖືກສ້າງພາຍໃຕ້ organization ໝາຍເລກ 1 ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cobbler list`` ຈະສະແດງດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:66
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "# cobbler list\n"
msgstr "# cobbler list\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:67
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"distros:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
msgstr ""
"distros:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"profiles:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
msgstr ""
"profiles:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:69
msgid ""
"These entries contain information about kernel and initrd.  These entries "
"are however not yet available for PXE booting."
msgstr "ລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບ kernel ແລະ initrd. ແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຍັງບໍ່ທັນພ້ອມສຳລັບ PXE booting ເທື່ອ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:70
msgid ""
"Only when [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` is created, new {cobbler} profile "
"is created for this [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` which points to "
"[systemitem]``cobbler distro`` based on default boot image configuration."
msgstr "ຕໍ່ເມື່ອມີການສ້າງ [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ, {cobbler} profile ໃໝ່ຈຶ່ງຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບ [systemitem]``Saltboot group`` ນີ້ ເຊິ່ງຈະຊີ້ໄປຫາ [systemitem]``cobbler distro`` ໂດຍອີງຕາມການກຳນົດຄ່າບູດອິເມຈເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:71
msgid ""
"For example, when system group [literal]``B0001`` is created and "
"[systemitem]``Saltboot group formula`` is assigned and configured for this "
"group, new {cobbler} profile is created."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ເມື່ອກຸ່ມລະບົບ [literal]``B0001`` ຖືກສ້າງ ແລະ ມີການມອບໝາຍພ້ອມກຳນົດຄ່າ [systemitem]``Saltboot group formula`` ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມນີ້, {cobbler} profile ໃໝ່ກໍຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"profiles:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
"   1-B0001\n"
msgstr ""
"profiles:\n"
"   1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
"   1-B0001\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:75
msgid ""
"When inspecting this new group using command [command]``cobbler profile "
"report --name 1-B0001`` details of this profile reveal configuration of this "
"{saltboot} group."
msgstr "ເມື່ອກວດສອບກຸ່ມໃໝ່ນີ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``cobbler profile report --name 1-B0001`` ລາຍລະອຽດຈະສະແດງການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງກຸ່ມ {saltboot} ນີ້."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "# cobbler profile report --name 1-B0001\n"
msgstr "# cobbler profile report --name 1-B0001\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Name                           : 1-B0001\n"
"Comment                        : Saltboot group B0001 of organization SUSE "
"default profile\n"
"Distribution                   : 1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
"Kernel Options                 : {'MASTER': ['downloadserver.example.org'], "
"'MINION_ID_PREFIX': ['B0001']}\n"
msgstr ""
"Name                           : 1-B0001\n"
"Comment                        : Saltboot group B0001 of organization SUSE default profile\n"
"Distribution                   : 1-POS_Image_JeOS7-7.0.0-1\n"
"Kernel Options                 : {'MASTER': ['downloadserver.example.org'], 'MINION_ID_PREFIX': ['B0001']}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:78
msgid ""
"Kernel options in example are always present and are internal for {saltboot} "
"functionality."
msgstr "Kernel options ໃນຕົວຢ່າງແມ່ນມີຢູ່ສະເໝີ ແລະ ເປັນຄ່າພາຍໃນສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:79
msgid ""
"With this information [systemitem]``Cobbler`` is able to generate required "
"PXE and UEFI Grub configurations which can be checked in "
"[path]``/srv/tftpboot/pxelinux.cfg/default`` and "
"[path]``/srv/tftpboot/grub/x86_64_menu_items.cfg``."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ [systemitem]``Cobbler`` ຈະສາມາດສ້າງການກຳນົດຄ່າ PXE ແລະ UEFI Grub ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ໃນ [path]``/srv/tftpboot/pxelinux.cfg/default`` ແລະ [path]``/srv/tftpboot/grub/x86_64_menu_items.cfg``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:80
msgid ""
"These files contain the end result which will be used by PXE client when "
"determining what to boot and with which parameters."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມີຜົນລັອກສຸດທ້າຍທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍ PXE client ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າຈະບູດຫຍັງ ແລະ ດ້ວຍພາຣາມິເຕີໃດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:81
msgid ""
"If all built OS images are removed while a branch {saltboot} group is "
"configured, the corresponding {cobbler} profile for this group will also be "
"removed.  This is expected behavior.  However, when a new image is "
"subsequently built, a new {cobbler} entry is not automatically generated for "
"the group, resulting in a missing entry in the boot menu."
msgstr "ຫາກ OS images ທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນຖືກລຶບອອກໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຸ່ມ {saltboot} ຂອງສາຂາຍັງຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢູ່, {cobbler} profile ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງກຸ່ມນັ້ນກໍຈະຖືກລຶບອອກນຳ. ນີ້ແມ່ນພຶດຕິກຳປົກກະຕິ. ແຕ່ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເມື່ອມີການສ້າງອິເມຈໃໝ່ຂຶ້ນມາແທນ, ລາຍການ {cobbler} ໃໝ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກສ້າງໃຫ້ກຸ່ມນັ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍການໃນເມນູບູດຫາຍໄປ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/containerized-saltboot.adoc:82
msgid ""
"To recreate the required {cobbler} entry, you must open and resave the "
"{saltboot} Group formula."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍການ {cobbler} ທີ່ຈຳເປັນຄືນໃໝ່, ທ່ານຕ້ອງເປີດ ແລະ ກົດບັນທຶກ (Save) ຟໍມູລາ {saltboot} Group ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment with Dedicated Network for "
"Terminal"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr} ດ້ວຍເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເພາະສຳລັບເທີມິນໍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:4
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:4
msgid "one or more {productname} {smr} branch server proxies"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} branch server proxies ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຕົວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:5
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:5
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:5
msgid "one or more POS images built"
msgstr "ມີ POS images ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ຖືກສ້າງແລ້ວ"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:6
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:6
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assumptions"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ສົມມຸດຖານ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This guide works only with non-containerized {productname} {smr} branch "
"proxy 4.3."
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ {productname} {smr} branch proxy 4.3 ແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນ containerized ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:8
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In this example we consider architecture with dedicated network for POS "
"terminals where branch server provides all required services including DHCP "
"and DNS."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຊ້ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ມີເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເພາະສຳລັບເທີມິນໍ POS ເຊິ່ງເຊີເວີສາຂາຈະເປັນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ ລວມທັງ DHCP ແລະ DNS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:9
msgid "For dedicated network we assume [literal]``192.168.86.0/24`` network."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເພາະ ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍ [literal]``192.168.86.0/24``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In this example we provide [systemitem]``{salt}`` and [systemitem]``ftp`` "
"CNAMEs for {saltboot} service discovery."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າ CNAME [systemitem]``{salt}`` ແລະ [systemitem]``ftp`` ສຳລັບການຄົ້ນຫາບໍລິການ {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:11
msgid ""
"We assume to have one regular branch server with {salt} minion id "
"[systemitem]``branch1.mystore.com``, which is equal to the branch server "
"fully qualified domain name, and branch id [systemitem]``B0001``."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າມີເຊີເວີສາຂາປົກກະຕິໜຶ່ງຕົວທີ່ມີ {salt} minion id ແມ່ນ [systemitem]``branch1.mystore.com``, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ແລະ ມີ branch id ແມ່ນ [systemitem]``B0001``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This example covers two configuration methods.  Both of the methods achieve "
"the same result."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ກວມເອົາສອງວິທີການກຳນົດຄ່າ. ເຊິ່ງທັງສອງວິທີຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັອກຄືກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create Required System Groups"
msgstr "ສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Manually setting up formulas requires manual creation of the needed system "
"groups, unlike when using the provided tools.  To create the system groups, "
"see xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຟໍມູລາດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ມີການສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ຈຳເປັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ບໍ່ຄືກັບການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ມີໃຫ້. ສຳລັບວິທີສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:17
msgid "You will need the following groups:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງມີກຸ່ມດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign and Configure Branch Server Formulas"
msgstr "ມອບໝາຍ ແລະ ກຳນົດຄ່າຟໍມູລາຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:24
msgid "We assign the following formulas to the branch server:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາມອບໝາຍຟໍມູລາດັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃຫ້ກັບເຊີເວີສາຂາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:25
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:23
msgid "Branch Network"
msgstr "Branch Network"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:26
msgid "Dhcpd"
msgstr "Dhcpd"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:27
msgid "Bind"
msgstr "Bind"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:28
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:24
msgid "Pxe"
msgstr "Pxe"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:29
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:25
msgid "Tftpd"
msgstr "Tftpd"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assign Formulas to the Branch Server"
