msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກສຳເລັດທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ໃນເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize Images"
msgstr "ຊິງຄ໌ອິເມຈ (Synchronize Images)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:138
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:66
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:90
msgid ""
"After highstate is applied, we proceed with synchronizing images as usual "
"with apply [systemitem]``image-sync`` state."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກນຳໃຊ້ highstate ແລ້ວ, ພວກເຮົາຈະດຳເນີນການຊິງຄ໌ອິເມຈຕາມປົກກະຕິໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້ [systemitem]``image-sync``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-formulas-43.adoc:139
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:67
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Terminal can now be started and will be automatically provisioned, pending "
"salt key acceptance."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເປີດເທີມິນໍໄດ້ແລ້ວ ແລະ ມັນຈະຖືກຈັດຕຽມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໂດຍລໍຖ້າການຍອມຮັບ salt key."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment with dedicated network for "
"terminal using bundled scripts"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr} ດ້ວຍເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເພາະສຳລັບເທີມິນໍໂດຍໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບທີ່ມີມາໃຫ້"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:7
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This guide works only with non-containerized {productname} {smr} branch "
"proxy 4.3"
msgstr "ຄູ່ມືນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ {productname} {smr} branch proxy 4.3 ແບບບໍ່ແມ່ນ containerized ເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:9
msgid "For dedicated network we assume 192.168.86.0/24 network."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເພາະ ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍ 192.168.86.0/24."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In this example we provide [systemitem]``salt`` and [systemitem]``ftp`` "
"CNAMEs for {saltboot} service discovery."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາຈະໃຫ້ຄ່າ CNAME [systemitem]``salt`` ແລະ [systemitem]``ftp`` ສຳລັບການຄົ້ນຫາບໍລິການ {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:11
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:10
msgid ""
"We assume to have one regular branch server with salt minion id "
"[systemitem]``branch1.mystore.com``, which is equal to the branch server "
"fully qualified domain name, and branch id [systemitem]``B0001``."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາສົມມຸດວ່າມີເຊີເວີສາຂາປົກກະຕິໜຶ່ງຕົວທີ່ມີ salt minion id ແມ່ນ [systemitem]``branch1.mystore.com``, ເຊິ່ງກົງກັບ FQDN ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ແລະ ມີ branch id ແມ່ນ [systemitem]``B0001``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This example covers two configuration methods with both of them achieving "
"same result."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ກວມເອົາສອງວິທີການກຳນົດຄ່າ ເຊິ່ງທັງສອງວິທີຈະໃຫ້ຜົນລັອກຄືກັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick set up of {productname} {smr} using {smr} tools"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {smr} ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື {smr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} provides command line tool "
"[command]``retail_branch_init``"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ມີເຄື່ອງມືແບບຄຳສັ່ງ (command line) [command]``retail_branch_init``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:17
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} provides mass import command line tool "
"[command]``retail_yaml``"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ມີເຄື່ອງມືແບບຄຳສັ່ງສຳລັບການນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ [command]``retail_yaml``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:18
msgid ""
"The branch server can be configured automatically using the "
"[command]``retail_branch_init`` command, as shown in this section."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສາຂາສາມາດຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``retail_branch_init``, ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງໃນສ່ວນນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Branch Server Formulas With a Helper Script"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າຟໍມູລາເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍສະຄຣິບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:20
msgid "Run following command on {productname} Server:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {productname} Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"retail_branch_init branch1.mystore.com --dedicated-nic eth1 \\\n"
"                                       --branch-prefix B0001 \\\n"
"                                       --server-domain branch1.mystore.com "
"\\\n"
"                                       --branch-ip 192.168.86.1 \\\n"
"                                       --dyn-range 192.168.86.10 "
"192.168.86.250 \\\n"
"                                       --netmask 255.255.255.0\n"
msgstr ""
"retail_branch_init branch1.mystore.com --dedicated-nic eth1 \\\n"
"                                       --branch-prefix B0001 \\\n"
"                                       --server-domain branch1.mystore.com \\\n"
"                                       --branch-ip 192.168.86.1 \\\n"
"                                       --dyn-range 192.168.86.10 192.168.86.250 \\\n"
"                                       --netmask 255.255.255.0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can use the [command]``retail_branch_init --help`` command for "
"additional options."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``retail_branch_init --help`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:23
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Verify that your changes have been configured correctly by checking the "
"{productname} {webui} branch server system formulas."
msgstr "ກວດສອບວ່າການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງທ່ານຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍການກວດເບິ່ງຟໍມູລາລະບົບຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:24
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:34
msgid "Apply highstate on the branch server."
msgstr "ນຳໃຊ້ highstate ໃນເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:25
msgid "Similar results can be achieved by using mass import command line tool."
msgstr "ຜົນລັອກທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືແບບຄຳສັ່ງສຳລັບການນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Branch Server Formulas With a Mass Import Tool"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດຄ່າຟໍມູລາເຊີເວີສາຂາດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື Mass Import"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:27
msgid "Prepare branch specific YAML file:"
msgstr "ຕຽມໄຟລ໌ YAML ສະເພາະສຳລັບສາຂາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:28
msgid "For example, create [systemitem]``branch.yaml`` file with content:"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ, ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ [systemitem]``branch.yaml`` ທີ່ມີເນື້ອໃນດັ່ງນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"branches:\n"
"  branch1.mystore.com:\n"
"    branch_prefix: B0001\n"
"    server_domain: branch1.mystore.com\n"
"    nic: eth1\n"
"    dedicated_nic: true\n"
"    configure_firewall: true\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.86.1\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0\n"
"    dyn_range:\n"
"        - 192.168.86.10\n"
"        - 192.168.86.250\n"
msgstr ""
"branches:\n"
"  branch1.mystore.com:\n"
"    branch_prefix: B0001\n"
"    server_domain: branch1.mystore.com\n"
"    nic: eth1\n"
"    dedicated_nic: true\n"
"    configure_firewall: true\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.86.1\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0\n"
"    dyn_range:\n"
"        - 192.168.86.10\n"
"        - 192.168.86.250\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For more information about mass import tool, see "
"xref:retail:retail-mass-config.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເຄື່ອງມື mass import, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:retail:retail-mass-config.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:31
msgid "Import branch information from YAML file to {productname}"
msgstr "ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນສາຂາຈາກໄຟລ໌ YAML ໄປຫາ {productname}"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "retail_yaml --from-yaml branch.yaml\n"
msgstr "retail_yaml --from-yaml branch.yaml\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Both [command]``retail_branch_init`` and [command]``retail_yaml`` commands "
"override existing configuration settings of the specified branch server."
msgstr "ທັງຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``retail_branch_init`` ແລະ [command]``retail_yaml`` ຈະຂຽນທັບການກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາທີ່ລະບຸ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/dedicated-with-scripts.adoc:36
msgid ""
"After the initial configuration done by command line tools, branch server "
"configuration can be further adjusted in {productname} {webui} through "
"branch server formulas."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກການກຳນົດຄ່າເບື້ອງຕົ້ນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືແບບຄຳສັ່ງແລ້ວ, ການກຳນົດຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ໃນ {productname} {webui} ຜ່ານຟໍມູລາເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

