#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Under the [literal]``Images`` section, there is a specific image called "
"[literal]``POS_Image_JeOS7`` with a version [literal]``7.1.0-1.`` It "
"provides various details such as the image URL for download, architecture, "
"hash, size, synchronization information, image type (in this case, "
"[literal]``PXE``), file system type, file name, and an inactive flag to "
"exclude it from auto-selection.  Additionally, it references the "
"corresponding boot image named [literal]``POS_Image_JeOS7-7.1.0-1.``"
msgstr "ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ [literal]``Images``, ມີອິເມຈສະເພາະທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [literal]``POS_Image_JeOS7`` ເວີຊັນ [literal]``7.1.0-1.`` ມັນໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ: URL ຂອງອິເມຈສຳລັບດາວໂຫຼດ, ສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ, hash, ຂະໜາດ, ຂໍ້ມູນການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ, ປະເພດອິເມຈ (ໃນກໍລະນີນີແມ່ນ [literal]``PXE``), ປະເພດລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ແຟລັກ inactive ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນມັນຈາກການເລືອກອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ມັນຍັງອ້າງອີງເຖິງອິເມຈບູດທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [literal]``POS_Image_JeOS7-7.1.0-1.``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The [literal]``boot_images`` section contains information about the boot "
"image [literal]``POS_Image_JeOS7-7.1.0-1.`` It specifies the details about "
"kernel and [path]``initrd``."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນ [literal]``boot_images`` ປະກອບດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບອິເມຈບູດ [literal]``POS_Image_JeOS7-7.1.0-1.`` ໂດຍລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບ kernel ແລະ [path]``initrd``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Image pillar can be modified via API.  This example retrieves the image "
"pillar for a given image ID, and changes the [literal]``Inactive`` flag to "
"[literal]``True`` and writes it back."
msgstr "Image pillar ສາມາດຖືກແກ້ໄຂຜ່ານ API ໄດ້. ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ຈະດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ image pillar ສຳລັບ image ID ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ແລ້ວປ່ຽນແຟລັກ [literal]``Inactive`` ໃຫ້ເປັນ [literal]``True`` ແລະ ບັນທຶກຄືນ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n"
"from xmlrpc.client import ServerProxy\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n"
"from xmlrpc.client import ServerProxy\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "MANAGER_URL = \"http://manager.example.com/rpc/api\"\n"
msgstr "MANAGER_URL = \"http://manager.example.com/rpc/api\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MANAGER_LOGIN = \"admin\"\n"
"MANAGER_PASSWORD = \"adminpass\"\n"
msgstr ""
"MANAGER_LOGIN = \"admin\"\n"
"MANAGER_PASSWORD = \"adminpass\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "IMAGE_ID=15\n"
msgstr "IMAGE_ID=15\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"client = ServerProxy(MANAGER_URL)\n"
"key = client.auth.login(MANAGER_LOGIN, MANAGER_PASSWORD)\n"
msgstr ""
"client = ServerProxy(MANAGER_URL)\n"
"key = client.auth.login(MANAGER_LOGIN, MANAGER_PASSWORD)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"pillar = client.image.getPillar(key, IMAGE_ID)\n"
"[(name, version_dict)] = pillar['images'].items()\n"
"[(version, image_data)] = version_dict.items()\n"
"image_data['inactive'] = True\n"
"client.image.setPillar(key, IMAGE_ID, pillar)\n"
msgstr ""
"pillar = client.image.getPillar(key, IMAGE_ID)\n"
"[(name, version_dict)] = pillar['images'].items()\n"
"[(version, image_data)] = version_dict.items()\n"
"image_data['inactive'] = True\n"
"client.image.setPillar(key, IMAGE_ID, pillar)\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-image-pillars.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "client.auth.logout(key)\n"
msgstr "client.auth.logout(key)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:3
msgid "{productname} Server"
msgstr "{productname} Server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:4
msgid "one or more {productname} {smr} branch server containerized proxy"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} branch server containerized proxy ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:5
msgid "one or more {productname} build hosts"
msgstr "{productname} build hosts ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:6
msgid ""
"network stack depending on selected network architecture, see "
"xref:retail:retail-network-arch.adoc[]"
msgstr "network stack ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ເລືອກ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:retail-network-arch.adoc[]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"This section covers how to configure your {productname} {smr} environment, "
"including:"
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr} ຂອງທ່ານ, ລວມທັງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:8
msgid "Prepare POS images"
msgstr "ກຽມ POS images"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:9
msgid "Prepare system groups for {saltboot}"
msgstr "ກຽມ system groups ສຳລັບ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:10
msgid "Configure services for {saltboot}"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການສຳລັບ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The very first time you set up the {productname} {smr} environment, you will "
"need to perform all configuration steps in order.  You will need to revisit "
"some of these steps later on as you are working with {productname} {smr}."
msgstr "ໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr}, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດຕາມທຸກຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕາມລຳດັບ. ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ກັບມາເຮັດບາງຂັ້ນຕອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄືນໃໝ່ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບ {productname} {smr}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For example, the first time you configure the branch server group, you will "
"need to have images prepared already.  If you are configuring more than one "
"branch server, the same images are reused across different branch server "
"groups."
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໃນຄັ້ງທຳອິດທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າກຸ່ມເຊີເວີສາຂາ, ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງກຽມອິເມຈໄວ້ຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ. ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີສາຂາຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງ, ອິເມຈດຽວກັນນັ້ນສາມາດຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ຄືນໃນກຸ່ມເຊີເວີສາຂາຕ່າງໆໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If you have an existing environment, and need to build new images, you do "
"not need to re-initialize the branches."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານມີສະພາບແວດລ້ອມທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການສ້າງອິເມຈໃໝ່, ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (re-initialize) ສາຂາໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare and Build Terminal Images"
msgstr "ກຽມ ແລະ ສ້າງອິເມຈເທີມີນໍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For information about {productname} image building, see "
"xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການສ້າງອິເມຈ {productname}, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:image-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} POS images are images specifically tailored for "
"{productname} {smr} environment and designed to be deployed using PXE "
"booting mechanism."
msgstr "ອິເມຈ {productname} {smr} POS ແມ່ນອິເມຈທີ່ຖືກອອກແບບມາສະເພາະສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr} ແລະ ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍໃຊ້ກົນໄກການບູດແບບ PXE."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "POS Image Templates"
msgstr "POS Image Templates"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"As starting point, {suse} provides basic templates at "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage[].  These "
"templates need to be adapted for specific usecases, for example by including "
"specific applications, configuration settings, and users."
msgstr "ໃນເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ, {suse} ໄດ້ໃຫ້ແທມເປລດ (templates) ພື້ນຖານຢູ່ທີ່ https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage[]. ແທມເປລດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການປັບແຕ່ງສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະຢ່າງ, ເຊັ່ນ: ການເພີ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"POS image templates and resulting images do not set a system user password.  "
"You will not be able to login as a system user to a system that has been "
"installed with a {suse} provided template without customization.  However "
"you can use Salt to manage clients without a system user password.  You can "
"use {salt} to set up a system user password after the terminal has been "
"deployed."
msgstr "POS image templates ແລະ ອິເມຈທີ່ໄດ້ນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ມີການຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບ. ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບກັບລະບົບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍແທມເປລດທີ່ {suse} ໃຫ້ມາໂດຍບໍ່ມີການປັບແຕ່ງ. ແນວໃດກໍ່ຕາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ Salt ເພື່ອຈັດການ clients ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງມີລະຫັດຜ່ານຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບກໍ່ໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ {salt} ເພື່ອຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ເທີມີນໍໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Validate POS Image Registration"
msgstr "ກວດສອບການລົງທະບຽນອິເມຈ POS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:21
msgid ""
"After POS image is successfully built and inspected by {productname}, you "
"can validate that POS boot image was correctly registered by following "
"procedure."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ອິເມຈ POS ຖືກສ້າງສຳເລັດ ແລະ ຖືກກວດສອບໂດຍ {productname} ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບໄດ້ວ່າອິເມຈບູດ POS ໄດ້ຖືກລົງທະບຽນຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງຫຼືບໍ່ ໂດຍການປະຕິບັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure Validate POS boot image"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການກວດສອບອິເມຈບູດ POS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:23
msgid "On {productname} command line execute following command:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} command line ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec cobbler distro list\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec cobbler distro list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:25
msgid "Your POS image should be listed with an organization name appended after it."
msgstr "ອິເມຈ POS ຂອງທ່ານຄວນຈະຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍການ ພ້ອມກັບມີຊື່ຂອງອົງກອນຕໍ່ທ້າຍ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Branch Identification"
msgstr "ການລະບຸຕົວຕົນຂອງສາຂາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:27
msgid "For every branch server choose its [systemitem]``branch id``."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເຊີເວີສາຂາທຸກເຄື່ອງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``branch id`` ຂອງມັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"As a [systemitem]``branch id`` select any alphanumerical string with up to "
"64 characters."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ [systemitem]``branch id``, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຂໍ້ຄວາມຕົວອັກສອນ ຫຼື ຕົວເລກໃດກໍ່ໄດ້ ທີ່ມີຄວາມຍາວສູງສຸດ 64 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Required System Groups"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:30
msgid "{productname} {smr} requires:"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:31
msgid ""
"branch system group for every branch server proxy, using "
"[systemitem]``branch id`` as its name"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະບົບສາຂາສຳລັບທຸກໆ branch server proxy, ໂດຍໃຊ້ [systemitem]``branch id`` ເປັນຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:32
msgid ""
"hardware type system group for every used hardware type, using "
"[systemitem]``HWTYPE:`` prefix in its name"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະບົບປະເພດຮາດແວສຳລັບທຸກໆປະເພດຮາດແວທີ່ໃຊ້, ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳນຳໜ້າ [systemitem]``HWTYPE:`` ໃນຊື່"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For more information about hardware type groups, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກຸ່ມປະເພດຮາດແວ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:34
msgid "Missing mandatory system group will cause terminal bootstrap to fail."
msgstr "ຫາກຂາດກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການ bootstrap ເທີມີນໍຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:35
msgid "{productname} {smr} also recognizes two optional groups for better overview:"
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ຍັງມີກຸ່ມທາງເລືອກອີກສອງກຸ່ມເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:37
msgid "[systemitem]``SERVERS``"
msgstr "[systemitem]``SERVERS``"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:38
msgid ""
"You can create system groups using the {productname} {webui}.  Navigate to "
"menu:Systems[System Groups] and click btn:[Create System Group]."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ {productname} {webui}. ໄປທີ່ເມນູ:Systems[System Groups] ແລະ ຄລິກ btn:[Create System Group]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:39
msgid ""
"For more information about system groups, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບກຸ່ມລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:40
msgid "During terminal bootstrap, terminal automatically joins:"
msgstr "ໃນລະຫວ່າງການ bootstrap ເທີມີນໍ, ເທີມີນໍຈະເຂົ້າຮ່ວມກຸ່ມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:41
msgid ""
"branch system group based on received [systemitem]``branch_id``. This will "
"make branch group formulas available to the terminal."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມລະບົບສາຂາ ໂດຍອີງຕາມ [systemitem]``branch_id`` ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ branch group formulas ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບເທີມີນໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:42
msgid ""
"HWType group based on SMBios information received from terminal. This will "
"make {saltboot} partitioning pillar available to the terminal."
msgstr "ກຸ່ມ HWType ໂດຍອີງຕາມຂໍ້ມູນ SMBios ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຈາກເທີມີນໍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ {saltboot} partitioning pillar ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບເທີມີນໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:43
msgid "[systemitem]``TERMINALS`` if this group exists."
msgstr "[systemitem]``TERMINALS`` ຫາກກຸ່ມນີ້ມີຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:44
msgid ""
"In case you plan to use the branch server container host as a monitoring "
"server with Prometheus, be aware that Prometheus demands additional hardware "
"resources.  For more information about installing Prometheus, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະໃຊ້ branch server container host ເປັນເຊີເວີກວດສອບ (monitoring) ດ້ວຍ Prometheus, ໃຫ້ຮູ້ໄວ້ວ່າ Prometheus ຕ້ອງການຊັບພະຍາກອນຮາດແວເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Prometheus, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In case you plan to use the branch server container host with Ansible "
"software, be aware that Ansible demands additional hardware resources.  For "
"more information about installing Ansible, see "
"xref:administration:ansible-integration.adoc[]."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະໃຊ້ branch server container host ກັບຊອບແວ Ansible, ໃຫ້ຮູ້ໄວ້ວ່າ Ansible ຕ້ອງການຊັບພະຍາກອນຮາດແວເພີ່ມເຕີມ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Ansible, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:administration:ansible-integration.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Before configuring {saltboot} group, make sure you already have at least one "
"POS image available."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າກຸ່ມ {saltboot}, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີອິເມຈ POS ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Containerized {productname} {smr} is configured using so called "
"[systemitem]``Saltboot Group``."
msgstr "Containerized {productname} {smr} ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍໃຊ້ສິ່ງທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:49
msgid ""
"{saltboot} groups are branch groups, system group with [systemitem]``branch "
"id`` as its name created in previous step, with [systemitem]``Saltboot "
"Group`` formula enabled."
msgstr "{saltboot} groups ແມ່ນກຸ່ມສາຂາ, ກຸ່ມລະບົບທີ່ມີຊື່ຕາມ [systemitem]``branch id`` ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ໂດຍມີການເປີດໃຊ້ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` formula."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:50
msgid ""
"[systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` formula is a successor of "
"[systemitem]``Branch Network formula``, [systemitem]``PXE formula`` and "
"[systemitem]``TFTP formula`` previously used in {productname} {smr} setups."
msgstr "[systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` formula ແມ່ນສິ່ງທີ່ມາແທນທີ່ [systemitem]``Branch Network formula``, [systemitem]``PXE formula`` ແລະ [systemitem]``TFTP formula`` ທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} {smr} ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:51
msgid ""
"To connect [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` with containerized proxy fill "
"[systemitem]``Image Download Server`` entry with Fully Qualified Domain Name "
"([literal]``FQDN``) of the containerized proxy."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` ກັບ containerized proxy, ໃຫ້ຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນໃນຊ່ອງ [systemitem]``Image Download Server`` ດ້ວຍຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (FQDN) ຂອງ containerized proxy ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Network Services for {saltboot}"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການເຄືອຂ່າຍສຳລັບ {saltboot}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:53
msgid ""
"{saltboot} technology is used to deploy POS images to the terminals.  "
"{saltboot} consists of saltboot enabled initrd (build as part of POS images) "
"and saltboot {salt} states."
msgstr "ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ {saltboot} ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງອິເມຈ POS ໃສ່ເທີມີນໍ. {saltboot} ປະກອບດ້ວຍ initrd ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ saltboot (ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງອິເມຈ POS) ແລະ saltboot {salt} states."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:54
msgid ""
"This section covers general information about generic {saltboot} "
"requirements.  For configuration examples, see "
"xref:retail:example-configurations.adoc[]."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ກວມເອົາຂໍ້ມູນທົ່ວໄປກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງ {saltboot}. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:example-configurations.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable PXE Network Boot in the Terminal Network"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ PXE Network Boot ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍເທີມີນໍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:56
msgid ""
"{saltboot} is usually used in network boot environment.  For this to work "
"[systemitem]``DHCP`` service for the network terminal is connected to must "
"have [systemitem]``PXE`` or sometimes called [systemitem]``BOOTP`` support "
"enabled."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ {saltboot} ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການບູດຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ບໍລິການ [systemitem]``DHCP`` ສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ເທີມີນໍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ ຕ້ອງມີການເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ [systemitem]``PXE`` ຫຼື ບາງຄັ້ງເອີ້ນວ່າ [systemitem]``BOOTP``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of ISC DHCP server configuration with PXE booting enabled"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ ISC DHCP ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ການບູດແບບ PXE"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  if substring (option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 10) = \"HTTPClient\" {\n"
"    option vendor-class-identifier \"HTTPClient\";\n"
"    filename \"<FQDN of branch server proxy>/saltboot/shim.efi\";\n"
"  }\n"
"  else {\n"
"    if option arch = 00:07 {\n"
"       filename \"grub/shim.efi\";\n"
"       next-server <IP address of branch server proxy>;\n"
"    }\n"
"    else {\n"
"      filename \"grub/grub.0\";\n"
"      next-server <IP address of branch server proxy>;\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
msgstr ""
"  if substring (option vendor-class-identifier, 0, 10) = \"HTTPClient\" {\n"
"    option vendor-class-identifier \"HTTPClient\";\n"
"    filename \"<FQDN of branch server proxy>/saltboot/shim.efi\";\n"
"  }\n"
"  else {\n"
"    if option arch = 00:07 {\n"
"       filename \"grub/shim.efi\";\n"
"       next-server <IP address of branch server proxy>;\n"
"    }\n"
"    else {\n"
"      filename \"grub/grub.0\";\n"
"      next-server <IP address of branch server proxy>;\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Notice two important options, [systemitem]``next-server`` which is set to "
"the branch server IP address and [systemitem]``filename`` set to the "
"[systemitem]``pxelinux.0`` for BIOS based system and "
"[systemitem]``grub/shim.efi`` for UEFI systems with SecureBoot support."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ສັງເກດສອງຕົວເລືອກທີ່ສຳຄັນ ຄື [systemitem]``next-server`` ເຊິ່ງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ ແລະ [systemitem]``filename`` ເຊິ່ງຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ [systemitem]``pxelinux.0`` ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ອີງໃສ່ BIOS ແລະ [systemitem]``grub/shim.efi`` ສຳລັບລະບົບ UEFI ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ SecureBoot."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} branch proxy uses different [systemitem]``filename`` "
"then previous non-containerized branch server."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} branch proxy ໃຊ້ [systemitem]``filename`` ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງຈາກເຊີເວີສາຂາແບບເກົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:61
msgid ""
"For containerized branch proxy set [systemitem]``filename`` to the "
"[systemitem]``pxelinux.0`` for BIOS based system and "
"[systemitem]``grub/shim.efi`` for UEFI systems with SecureBoot."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ containerized branch proxy, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງ [systemitem]``filename`` ເປັນ [systemitem]``pxelinux.0`` ສຳລັບລະບົບ BIOS ແລະ [systemitem]``grub/shim.efi`` ສຳລັບລະບົບ UEFI ທີ່ມີ SecureBoot."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminal Partitioning and Image Selection"
msgstr "ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນເທີມີນໍ ແລະ ການເລືອກອິເມຈ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:63
msgid ""
"{saltboot} requires instructions how to partitioning terminal harddisk and "
"what image to deploy.  This is done individually for each hardware type of "
"terminals.  For more information about hardware types and partitioning, see "
"xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."
msgstr "{saltboot} ຕ້ອງການຄຳສັ່ງກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນຮາດດິສກ໌ຂອງເທີມີນໍ ແລະ ຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງອິເມຈໃດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດແຍກກັນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະປະເພດຮາດແວຂອງເທີມີນໍ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບປະເພດຮາດແວ ແລະ ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:retail-deploy-terminals.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Above mentioned steps are mandatory minimum for successful {saltboot} "
"deployment.  For configuration examples, see "
"xref:retail:example-configurations.adoc[]."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນທີ່ກ່າວມາຂ້າງເທິງແມ່ນຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຕິດຕັ້ງ {saltboot} ສຳເລັດ. ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:example-configurations.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:66
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} {productnumber} no longer need manual image "
"synchronization, all images are available to all clients automatically."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} {productnumber} ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການຊິງໂຄຣໄນອິເມຈດ້ວຍຕົນເອງອີກຕໍ່ໄປ, ທຸກອິເມຈຈະພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບທຸກ clients ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"This may not be always desired, for example to allow images gradual "
"deployments across all branches.  For a way how to limit image deployment, "
"see xref:retail:retail-best-practices.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະບໍ່ເປັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການສະເໝີໄປ, ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການທະຍອຍຕິດຕັ້ງອິເມຈໃນແຕ່ລະສາຂາ. ສຳລັບວິທີການຈຳກັດການຕິດຕັ້ງອິເມຈ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:retail:retail-best-practices.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Uyuni Retail Server with openSUSE"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Uyuni Retail Server ດ້ວຍ openSUSE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:2
msgid "{productname} {smr} Server can be installed on openSUSE."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} Server ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້ໃນ openSUSE."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For general requirements, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການທົ່ວໄປ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:uyuni-install-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information about the latest version and updates of openSUSE Leap, "
"see https://doc.opensuse.org/release-notes/."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບເວີຊັນຫຼ້າສຸດ ແລະ ການອັບເດດຂອງ openSUSE Leap, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ https://doc.opensuse.org/release-notes/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Uyuni on openSUSE Leap"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ Uyuni ໃນ openSUSE Leap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:6
msgid "You install Uyuni as an add-on to openSUSE Leap."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ Uyuni ເປັນສ່ວນເສີມ (add-on) ໃຫ້ກັບ openSUSE Leap."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Uyuni on openSUSE Leap"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Uyuni ໃນ openSUSE Leap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:8
msgid ""
"As the base system, install openSUSE Leap with all available service packs "
"and package updates applied."
msgstr "ໃນຖານະລະບົບພື້ນຖານ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ openSUSE Leap ພ້ອມກັບການນຳໃຊ້ທຸກ service packs ແລະ ການອັບເດດແພັກເກດທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Configure a resolvable fully qualified domain name (FQDN) with "
"menu:yast[System > Network Settings > Hostname/DNS]."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຊື່ໂດເມນເຕັມ (FQDN) ທີ່ສາມາດລະບຸຕົວຕົນໄດ້ຜ່ານ menu:yast[System > Network Settings > Hostname/DNS]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Set variables to use to create repository:"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນ (variables) ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນການສ້າງ repository:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"
msgstr ""
"repo=repositories/systemsmanagement:/\n"
"repo=${repo}Uyuni:/Stable/images/repo/Uyuni-Server-POOL-x86_64-Media1/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Add the repository for installing the {productname} Server software as "
"[systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ repository ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຊອບແວ {productname} Server ໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-server-stable\n"
msgstr "zypper ar https://download.opensuse.org/$repo uyuni-server-stable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Refresh metadata from the repositories as [systemitem]``root``, and confirm "
"the import of new GPG key into the keyring:"
msgstr "ຣີເຟຣຊ (Refresh) ເມຕາດາຕາຈາກ repositories ໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root``, ແລະ ຢືນຢັນການນຳເຂົ້າ GPG key ໃໝ່ໄປຍັງ keyring:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper ref\n"
msgstr "zypper ref\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid "Install the pattern for the {productname} Server as [systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ pattern ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in patterns-uyuni_server\n"
msgstr "zypper in patterns-uyuni_server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Install the pattern for the {productname} {smr} product as "
"[systemitem]``root``:"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງ pattern ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ {productname} {smr} ໃນຖານະ [systemitem]``root``:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in patterns-uyuni_retail\n"
msgstr "zypper in patterns-uyuni_retail\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Reboot the {productname} {smr} Server."
msgstr "ຣີສະຕາດ (Reboot) {productname} {smr} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install-uyuni.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Continue with the server setup as described in "
"xref:retail:retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີຕໍ່ ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ xref:retail:retail-uyuni-server-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retail Installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ Retail"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} {smr} and {productname} {smr} Branch Server are already part "
"of {productname} {productnumber} Server and Proxy containers."
msgstr "{productname} {smr} ແລະ {productname} {smr} Branch Server ແມ່ນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ {productname} {productnumber} Server ແລະ Proxy containers ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-install.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} Retail Server and {productname} Retail Branch Server are "
"already part of {productname} Server and Proxy containers."
msgstr "{productname} Retail Server ແລະ {productname} Retail Branch Server ແມ່ນເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy containers ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#.  REMARK: ATM, the second method is disabled; cf. the jeos installation that here will probably work as well
#.  REMARK: Shall we enable retail-install-packages.adoc again?  Or better use jeos?
#.  REMARK: For the moment, commenting the following misleading sentences:
#.  However, it is also possible to install {productname} {smr} manually from packages.
#.  Both methods are described in this manual.
#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example YAML File for Mass Configuration"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ YAML ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can use the [command]``retail_yaml`` command to import configuration "
"parameters from a manually prepared YAML file.  This section contains a YAML "
"example file with comments."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``retail_yaml`` ເພື່ອນຳເຂົ້າພາຣາມິເຕີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈາກໄຟລ໌ YAML ທີ່ກຽມໄວ້ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ YAML ພ້ອມກັບຄຳອະທິບາຍ (comments)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example: YAML Mass Terminal Configuration File"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ: ໄຟລ໌ YAML ສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າເທີມີນໍແບບຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-mass-config-yaml.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"branches:\n"
"# there are 2 possible setups: with / without dedicated NIC\n"
"#\n"
"# with dedicated NIC\n"
"  branchserver1.branch1.cz:     # salt ID of branch server\n"
"    branch_prefix: branch1      # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    server_name: branchserver1  # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    server_domain: branch1.cz   # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    nic: eth1                   # nic used for connecting terminals, default "
"taken from hw info in MLM\n"
"    dedicated_nic: true         # set to true if the terminals are on "
"separate network\n"
"    salt_cname: branchserver1.branch1.cz      # hostname of salt master / "
"broker for terminals, mandatory\n"
"    configure_firewall: true    # modify firewall configuration\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.2.1      # default for dedicated NIC: 192.168.1.1\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0      # default for dedicated NIC: 255.255.255.0\n"
"    dyn_range:                  # default for dedicated NIC: 192.168.1.10 - "
"192.168.1.250\n"
"        - 192.168.2.10\n"
"        - 192.168.2.250\n"
"# without dedicated NIC\n"
"# the DHCP formula is not used, DHCP is typically provided by a router\n"
"# the network parameters can be autodetected if the machine is already "
"connected to SUSE Manager\n"
"  branchserver2.branch2.cz:     # salt ID of branch server\n"
"    branch_prefix: branch2      # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    server_name: branchserver2  # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    server_domain: branch2.cz   # optional, default guessed from salt id\n"
"    salt_cname: branchserver2.branch1.cz      # FQDN of salt master / broker "
"for terminals, mandatory\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.2.1      # optional, default taken from MLM data if "
"the machine is registered\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0      # optional, default taken from MLM data if "
"the machine is registered\n"
"    exclude_formulas:           # optional, do not configure listed "
"formulas\n"
"      - dhcp                    # without dedicated NIC the dhcp service is "
"typically provided by a router\n"
"    hwAddress: 11:22:33:44:55:66 # optional, required to connect "
"pre-configured entry with particular machine\n"
"                                 # during onboarding\n"
"    terminals:                       # configuration of static terminal "
"entries\n"
"      hostname1:                     # hostname\n"
"        hwAddress: aa:aa:aa:bb:bb:bb # required as unique id of a terminal\n"
"        IP: 192.168.2.50             # required for static dhcp and dns "
"entry\n"
"        saltboot:                    # optional, alternative 1: configure "
"terminal-specific pillar data\n"
"          partitioning:              # partitioning pillar as described in "
"saltboot documentation\n"
"            disk1:\n"
"              device: /dev/sda\n"
"              disklabel: msdos\n"
"              partitions:\n"
"                p1:\n"
"                  flags: swap\n"
"                  format: swap\n"
"                  size_MiB: 2000.0\n"
"                p2:\n"
"                  image: POS_Image_JeOS6\n"
"                  mountpoint: /\n"
"              type: DISK\n"
"      hostname2:                     # hostname\n"
"        hwAddress: aa:aa:aa:bb:bb:cc # required as unique id of a terminal\n"
"        IP: 192.168.2.51             # required for static dhcp and dns "
"entry\n"
"        hwtype: IBMCORPORATION-4838910 # optional, alternative 2: assign the "
"terminal to hwtype group\n"
"        # if neither of hwtype nor saltboot is specified, a group is "
"assigned according to hwtype\n"
"        # reported by bios on the first boot\n"
"hwtypes:\n"
"  IBMCORPORATION-4838910:      # HWTYPE string (manufacturer-model) as "
"returned by bios\n"
"    description: 4838-910       # freetext description\n"
"    saltboot:\n"
"      partitioning:             # partitioning pillar as described in "
"saltboot documentation\n"
"        disk1:\n"
"          device: /dev/sda\n"
"          disklabel: msdos\n"
"          partitions:\n"
"            p1:\n"
"              flags: swap\n"
"              format: swap\n"
"              size_MiB: 1000.0\n"
"            p2:\n"
"              image: POS_Image_JeOS6\n"
"              mountpoint: /\n"
"          type: DISK\n"
"  TOSHIBA-6140100:\n"
"    description: HWTYPE:TOSHIBA-6140100\n"
"    saltboot:\n"
"      partitioning:\n"
"        disk1:\n"
"          device: /dev/sda\n"
"          disklabel: msdos\n"
"          partitions:\n"
"            p1:\n"
"              flags: swap\n"
"              format: swap\n"
"              size_MiB: 1000.0\n"
"            p2:\n"
"              image: POS_Image_JeOS6\n"
"              mountpoint: /\n"
"          type: DISK\n"
msgstr ""
"ສາຂາ:\n"
"# ມີ 2 ຮູບແບບການຕິດຕັ້ງທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້: ແບບມີ / ບໍ່ມີ NIC ສະເພາະ\n"
"#\n"
"# ແບບມີ NIC ສະເພາະ\n"
"  branchserver1.branch1.cz:     # salt ID ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ\n"
"    branch_prefix: branch1      # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄາດເດົາຈາກ salt id\n"
"    server_name: branchserver1  # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄາດເດົາຈາກ salt id\n"
"    server_domain: branch1.cz   # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄາດເດົາຈາກ salt id\n"
"    nic: eth1                   # nic ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງ, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເອົາມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ hw ໃນ MLM\n"
"    dedicated_nic: true         # ກຳນົດເປັນ true ຖ້າເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງຢູ່ຄົນລະເຄືອຂ່າຍ\n"
"    salt_cname: branchserver1.branch1.cz      # ຊື່ໂຮສຂອງ salt master / broker ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ\n"
"    configure_firewall: true    # ປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍ\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.2.1      # ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ NIC ສະເພາະ: 192.168.1.1\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0      # ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ NIC ສະເພາະ: 255.255.255.0\n"
"    dyn_range:                  # ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ NIC ສະເພາະ: 192.168.1.10 - 192.168.1.250\n"
"        - 192.168.2.10\n"
"        - 192.168.2.250\n"
"# ແບບບໍ່ມີ NIC ສະເພາະ\n"
"# ບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ສູດ DHCP, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ DHCP ແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກຣາວເຕີ\n"
"# ພາຣາມິເຕີເຄືອຂ່າຍສາມາດກວດຫາໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຖ້າເຄື່ອງໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ SUSE Manager ແລ້ວ\n"
"  branchserver2.branch2.cz:     # salt ID ຂອງເຊີເວີສາຂາ\n"
"    branch_prefix: branch2      # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄາດເດົາຈາກ salt id\n"
"    server_name: branchserver2  # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄາດເດົາຈາກ salt id\n"
"    server_domain: branch2.cz   # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄາດເດົາຈາກ salt id\n"
"    salt_cname: branchserver2.branch1.cz      # FQDN ຂອງ salt master / broker ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງ, ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ\n"
"    branch_ip: 192.168.2.1      # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເອົາມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ MLM ຖ້າເຄື່ອງໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ\n"
"    netmask: 255.255.255.0      # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເອົາມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ MLM ຖ້າເຄື່ອງໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ\n"
"    exclude_formulas:           # ເລືອກໄດ້, ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້\n"
"      - dhcp                    # ຫາກບໍ່ມີ NIC ສະເພາະ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວບໍລິການ dhcp ແມ່ນໄດ້ມາຈາກຣາວເຕີ\n"
"    hwAddress: 11:22:33:44:55:66 # ເລືອກໄດ້, ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລາຍການທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າກັບເຄື່ອງສະເພາະໃດໜຶ່ງ\n"
"                                 # ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ (onboarding)\n"
"    terminals:                       # ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລາຍການເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງແບບຄົງທີ່\n"
"      hostname1:                     # ຊື່ໂຮສ\n"
"        hwAddress: aa:aa:aa:bb:bb:bb # ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີເພື່ອເປັນ ID ສະເພາະຂອງເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງ\n"
"        IP: 192.168.2.50             # ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບລາຍການ dhcp ແລະ dns ແບບຄົງທີ່\n"
"        saltboot:                    # ເລືອກໄດ້, ທາງເລືອກທີ 1: ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ມູນ pillar ສະເພາະເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງ\n"
"          partitioning:              # ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ pillar ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານ saltboot\n"
"            disk1:\n"
"              device: /dev/sda\n"
"              disklabel: msdos\n"
"              partitions:\n"
"                p1:\n"
"                  flags: swap\n"
"                  format: swap\n"
"                  size_MiB: 2000.0\n"
"                p2:\n"
"                  image: POS_Image_JeOS6\n"
"                  mountpoint: /\n"
"              type: DISK\n"
"      hostname2:                     # ຊື່ໂຮສ\n"
"        hwAddress: aa:aa:aa:bb:bb:cc # ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີເພື່ອເປັນ ID ສະເພາະຂອງເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງ\n"
"        IP: 192.168.2.51             # ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບລາຍການ dhcp ແລະ dns ແບບຄົງທີ່\n"
"        hwtype: IBMCORPORATION-4838910 # ເລືອກໄດ້, ທາງເລືອກທີ 2: ກຳນົດເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມ hwtype\n"
"        # ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸທັງ hwtype ຫຼື saltboot, ກຸ່ມຈະຖືກກຳນົດຕາມ hwtype\n"
"        # ທີ່ລາຍງານໂດຍ bios ໃນການບູດເຄື່ອງຄັ້ງທຳອິດ\n"
"hwtypes:\n"
"  IBMCORPORATION-4838910:      # ຂໍ້ຄວາມ HWTYPE (ຜູ້ຜະລິດ-ລຸ້ນ) ຕາມທີ່ bios ສົ່ງຄືນມາ\n"
"    description: 4838-910       # ລາຍລະອຽດຂໍ້ຄວາມທົ່ວໄປ\n"
"    saltboot:\n"
"      partitioning:             # ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ pillar ຕາມທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນເອກະສານ saltboot\n"
"        disk1:\n"
