#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} performance depends on hardware resources, network bandwidth, "
"latency between clients and server, etc."
msgstr "ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ {productname} ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຊັບພະຍາກອນຮາດແວ, ແບນວິດຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ, ຄ່າຄວາມໜ່ວງ (latency) ລະຫວ່າງ clients ແລະ server, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Based on the experience and different deployments that are in use, the "
"advice for optimal performance of {productname} Server with an adequate "
"number of proxies is to not exceed 10,000 clients per single server.  It is "
"highly recommended to move to the Hub setup and involve consultancy when you "
"have more than 10,000 clients.  Even with fine-tuning and an adequate number "
"of proxies, such a large number of clients can lead to performance issues."
msgstr "ອີງຕາມປະສົບການ ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງນຳໃຊ້ໃນຮູບແບບຕ່າງໆ, ຄຳແນະນຳເພື່ອໃຫ້ໄດ້ປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດສຳລັບ {productname} Server ທີ່ມີຈຳນວນ proxies ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ແມ່ນບໍ່ຄວນເກີນ 10,000 clients ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງເຄື່ອງແມ່ຂ່າຍ. ຂໍແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງໃຫ້ປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບ Hub ແລະ ປຶກສາຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານຫາກທ່ານມີ clients ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 10,000 ເຄື່ອງ. ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີການປັບແຕ່ງ ແລະ ມີ proxies ໃນຈຳນວນທີ່ພໍດີ, ແຕ່ຈຳນວນ clients ທີ່ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປກໍ່ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about managing a large number of clients, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຈັດການ clients ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/hub-multi-server.adoc[]."

