#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:19
msgid "The {productname} Server requires a reliable and fast WAN connection."
msgstr "{productname} Server ຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN ທີ່ໄວ ແລະ ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The branch server requires a reliable WAN connection, to reach the "
"{productname} Server."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສາຂາຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ WAN ທີ່ເຊື່ອຖືໄດ້ ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ {productname} Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:21
msgid ""
"If you are using a dedicated network, the branch server requires at least "
"two network interfaces: one connected to the WAN with a reachable "
"{productname} Server, and one connected to the internal branch LAN."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ເຊີເວີສາຂາຕ້ອງການອິນເຕີເຟດເຄືອຂ່າຍຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງອັນ: ອັນໜຶ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ WAN ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} Server ໄດ້, ແລະ ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ LAN ພາຍໃນສາຂາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/retail-requirements.adoc:22
msgid "Terminals require a LAN connection to the branch server network."
msgstr "ເທີມີນໍຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ LAN ໄປຫາເຄືອຂ່າຍເຊີເວີສາຂາ."

