#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set Up the {productname} {smr} Environment with shared network between "
"terminals, branch servers and {productname}"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} {smr} ດ້ວຍເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງເທີມິນໍ, branch servers ແລະ {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:8
msgid ""
"In this example we consider architecture with shared network between POS "
"terminals, branch server and {productname} where branch server provides only "
"PXE configuration and images."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາພິຈາລະນາສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳທີ່ມີເຄືອຂ່າຍຮ່ວມກັນລະຫວ່າງ POS terminals, branch server ແລະ {productname} ໂດຍທີ່ branch server ຈະສະໜອງພຽງແຕ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PXE ແລະ ອິເມຈເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In this example we provide [systemitem]``salt`` on kernel command line "
"option and [systemitem]``ftp`` in pillar for {saltboot} service discovery."
msgstr "ໃນຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ພວກເຮົາລະບຸ [systemitem]``salt`` ໃນຕົວເລືອກ kernel command line ແລະ [systemitem]``ftp`` ໃນ pillar ສຳລັບການຄົ້ນຫາບໍລິການ {saltboot}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:13
msgid ""
"There is already existing external DHCP and DNS service.  DHCP service is "
"correctly configured to PXE boot from branch server."
msgstr "ມີບໍລິການ DHCP ແລະ DNS ພາຍນອກທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ບໍລິການ DHCP ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ PXE boot ຈາກ branch server ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Follow guide xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[] to create the "
"system groups:"
msgstr "ປະຕິບັດຕາມຄູ່ມື xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[] ເພື່ອສ້າງກຸ່ມລະບົບ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:19
msgid ""
"First group is generic optional group for collecting all POS "
"terminals. Second group is hardware type group for our POS terminal. Third "
"group is mandatory branch group.s"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມທຳອິດແມ່ນກຸ່ມທາງເລືອກທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບລວບລວມ POS terminals ທັງໝົດ. ກຸ່ມທີສອງແມ່ນກຸ່ມປະເພດຮາດແວສຳລັບ POS terminal ຂອງພວກເຮົາ. ກຸ່ມທີສາມແມ່ນກຸ່ມສາຂາ (branch group) ທີ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign and configure formulas"
msgstr "ກຳນົດ ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດຄຳນວນ (formulas)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:22
msgid "We assign following formulas to the branch server:"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາກຳນົດສູດຄຳນວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃຫ້ກັບ branch server:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assign formulas to the branch server"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກຳນົດສູດຄຳນວນໃຫ້ກັບ branch server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Unselect [systemitem]``Dedicated Nic`` check-box because we are not using "
"dedicated network"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກຊ່ອງ [systemitem]``Dedicated Nic`` ເພາະວ່າພວກເຮົາບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເພາະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In [systemitem]``Terminal Naming and Identification`` section edit "
"[systemitem]``Branch Identification`` and set it to our branch id "
"[systemitem]``B0001``"
msgstr "ໃນສ່ວນ [systemitem]``Terminal Naming and Identification`` ໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂ [systemitem]``Branch Identification`` ແລະ ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ branch id ຂອງພວກເຮົາ [systemitem]``B0001``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:41
msgid ""
"At the end of [systemitem]``Kernel Command Line Parameters`` append "
"[literal]``MASTER=branch1.mystore.com``"
msgstr "ທີ່ສ່ວນທ້າຍຂອງ [systemitem]``Kernel Command Line Parameters`` ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມ [literal]``MASTER=branch1.mystore.com`` ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:46
msgid ""
"Set [systemitem]``Internal Network Address`` to [literal]``0.0.0.0``, this "
"way tftp will be listening on any IPv4"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [systemitem]``Internal Network Address`` ເປັນ [literal]``0.0.0.0``, ວິທີນີ້ tftp ຈະລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນທຸກໆ IPv4."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:47
msgid "Set [systemitem]``TFTP base directory`` to [literal]``/srv/saltboot``"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [systemitem]``TFTP base directory`` ເປັນ [literal]``/srv/saltboot``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Next two formulas are group formulas.  Make sure you are editing those "
"formulas in their respective groups."
msgstr "ສອງສູດຄຳນວນຖັດໄປແມ່ນສູດຄຳນວນລະດັບກຸ່ມ. ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂສູດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໃນກຸ່ມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Group formulas are visible as assigned also on system level, but editing "
"them will create system specific setting instead of group setting."
msgstr "ສູດຄຳນວນລະດັບກຸ່ມຈະປະກົດໃຫ້ເຫັນວ່າຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນລະດັບລະບົບນຳ, ແຕ່ການແກ້ໄຂພວກມັນຈະເປັນການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າສະເພາະລະບົບ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະດັບກຸ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Assign [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` formula to the [systemitem]``B0001`` "
"group and [systemitem]``Saltboot`` formula to the "
"[systemitem]``HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000`` group."
msgstr "ກຳນົດສູດ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group`` ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມ [systemitem]``B0001`` ແລະ ສູດ [systemitem]``Saltboot`` ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມ [systemitem]``HWType:TerminalOEM-T1000``."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assign {saltboot} Group formula to Branch group"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ກຳນົດສູດ {saltboot} Group ໃຫ້ກັບກຸ່ມສາຂາ (Branch group)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:54
msgid "Select group [systemitem]``B0001`, which is our branch group"
msgstr "ເລືອກກຸ່ມ [systemitem]``B0001``, ເຊິ່ງແມ່ນກຸ່ມສາຂາຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:57
msgid "In displayed list select [systemitem]``Saltboot Group``"
msgstr "ໃນລາຍການທີ່ສະແດງ ໃຫ້ເລືອກ [systemitem]``Saltboot Group``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:58
msgid "Save assigned formulas by clicking btn:[Save] in the top right corner"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກສູດທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໂດຍການກົດ btn:[Save] ທີ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure {saltboot} Group formula"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ຕັ້ງຄ່າສູດ {saltboot} Group"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Select {saltboot} Group formula from [systemitem]``B0001`` group formula "
"list"
msgstr "ເລືອກສູດ {saltboot} Group ຈາກລາຍການສູດຂອງກຸ່ມ [systemitem]``B0001``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Set [systemitem]``Image download server`` to "
"[systemitem]``branch1.mystore.com``"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ [systemitem]``Image download server`` ເປັນ [systemitem]``branch1.mystore.com``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/shared-central-dns.adoc:62
msgid ""
"Unselect [systemitem]``Branch server is containerized proxy`` because this "
"is not containerized proxy"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ [systemitem]``Branch server is containerized proxy`` ເພາະວ່ານີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນ containerized proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:8
#: en/modules/retail/pages/uyuni-retail-overview.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For additional guidance, refer to the **{productname} documentation suite** "
"at https://www.uyuni-project.org/uyuni-docs."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ **{productname} documentation suite** ທີ່ https://www.uyuni-project.org/uyuni-docs."

