#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/partials/add_channels_cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Software Channels at the Command Prompt"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງຊອບແວທີ່ Command Prompt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/add_channels_cli.adoc:2
msgid ""
"With the [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` command you can add the "
"appropriate channels.  At the command prompt on the {productname} container "
"host, as root, execute the following command:"
msgstr "ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``spacewalk-common-channels`` ເຈົ້າສາມາດເພີ່ມຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້. ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} container host, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/partials/add_channels_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"<base_channel_name> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_name_n>\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- spacewalk-common-channels \\\n"
"<base_channel_name> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_1> \\\n"
"<child_channel_name_2> \\\n"
"... <child_channel_name_n>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/add_channels_cli.adoc:4
msgid "Synchronize the channels:"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ່ອງທາງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/partials/add_channels_cli.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Checking Synchronization Progress from the Command Prompt"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຈາກ Command Prompt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:2
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the {productname} Server, as root, use the "
"[command]``tail`` command to check the synchronization log file:"
msgstr "ທີ່ command prompt ຂອງ {productname} Server, ໃນຖານະ root, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``tail`` ເພື່ອກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (log) ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/check_sync_cli.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Each child channel generates its own log during the synchronization "
"progress.  You will need to check all the base and child channel log files "
"to be sure that the synchronization is complete."
msgstr "ແຕ່ລະຊ່ອງທາງລູກຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງມັນເອງໃນລະຫວ່າງການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ. ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຂອງທັງໝົດທັງ base ແລະ child channels ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/partials/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Checking Synchronization Progress"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການກວດສອບຄວາມຄືບໜ້າການຊິງໂຄຣໄນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"then click the channel associated to the repository."
msgstr "ໃນ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ໄປທີ່ menu:Software[Manage > Channels], ຈາກນັ້ນກົດທີ່ຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບ repository ນັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/check_sync_webui_uyuni.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Navigate to the [guimenu]``Repositories`` tab, then click [guimenu]``Sync`` "
"and check [systemitem]``Sync Status``."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ແຖບ [guimenu]``Repositories``, ຈາກນັ້ນກົດ [guimenu]``Sync`` ແລະ ກວດສອບ [systemitem]``Sync Status``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:1
msgid ""
"By default, some operating systems do not trust the GPG key for the "
"{productname} client tools.  The clients can be successfully bootstrapped "
"without the GPG key being trusted.  However, you will not be able to install "
"new client tool packages or update them until the keys are trusted."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບາງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການບໍ່ເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍຂອງ {productname}. ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດເຮັດ bootstrap ໄດ້ສຳເລັດໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ກໍໄດ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຈົ້າຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກັດເຄື່ອງມືລູກຂ່າຍໃໝ່ ຫຼື ອັບເດດພວກມັນໄດ້ ຈົນກວ່າຄີຈະໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/retail/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Trusting GPG Keys on Clients"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືຄີ GPG ໃນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, check the contents of "
"the [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/`` directory.  This directory contains all "
"available public keys.  Take a note of the key that applies to the client "
"you are registering."
msgstr "ຢູ່ເທິງ {productname} Server, ທີ່ command prompt, ໃຫ້ກວດເບິ່ງເນື້ອຫາໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/srv/www/htdocs/pub/``. ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ປະກອບມີຄີສາທາລະນະທີ່ມີຢູ່ທັງໝົດ. ໃຫ້ຈົດບັນທຶກຄີທີ່ໃຊ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຈົ້າກຳລັງລົງທະບຽນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Open the relevant bootstrap script, locate the [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY=`` "
"parameter and add the required key.  You do not need to delete any "
"previously stored keys.  For example:"
msgstr "ເປີດສະຄຣິບ bootstrap ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ, ຊອກຫາພາຣາມິເຕີ [systemitem]``ORG_GPG_KEY=`` ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄີທີ່ຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າໄປ. ເຈົ້າບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລຶບຄີທີ່ເຄີຍເກັບໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ຕົວຢ່າງ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/retail/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "uyuni-gpg-pubkey-0d20833e.key\n"
msgstr "uyuni-gpg-pubkey-0d20833e.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/retail/partials/trust_gpg.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you are bootstrapping clients from the {productname} {webui}, you will "
"need to use a Salt state to trust the key.  Create the Salt state and assign "
"it to the organization.  You can then use an activation key and "
"configuration channels to deploy the key to the clients."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຈົ້າກຳລັງເຮັດ bootstrap ລູກຂ່າຍຈາກ {webui} ຂອງ {productname}, ເຈົ້າຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ Salt state ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຄວາມເຊື່ອຖືຄີ. ສ້າງ Salt state ແລະ ກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບອົງກອນ. ຈາກນັ້ນເຈົ້າສາມາດໃຊ້ activation key ແລະ configuration channels ເພື່ອສົ່ງ (deploy) ຄີໄປໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້."
